    "title": "Embarrassment For MSNBC, CNN As Upstart NewsNation Wins Out In Primetime Ratings - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Eliana Johnson ,\n8 hours ago NewsNation, an upstart, middle-of-the-road network, embarrassed CNN and MSNBC by beating the liberal legacy networks in the coveted 25-54 age demographic during its Saturday primetime lineup. NewsNation averaged 44,000 viewers in the age group during the 8 p.m. hour when it ran its special report, The Killing of Charlie Kirk,... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
